{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/add_to_wishlist.gif?t=1751399414\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Heaven's Dale needs you...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Help your community grow happily by completing dozens of unique missions that always reward you with new content! At your own pace!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/Strip2.png?t=1751399414\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>So much to do...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>My Heaven's Dale</i></strong> offers simple gameplay, daily-changing songs, plenty of activities, 3 achievement rooms to complete and a main story to follow!\u00a0A non-stressful experience, perfect for disconnecting while you enjoy many hours of content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/68ad7457e9a9e1fb85b85d66fd07e254.poster.webp?t=1751399414\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/68ad7457e9a9e1fb85b85d66fd07e254.webp?t=1751399414\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/54855d03fe1a5105d72a4b80ac043d16.poster.webp?t=1751399414\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/54855d03fe1a5105d72a4b80ac043d16.webp?t=1751399414\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>There's something about that place...\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't have to stay on planet Earth! Take a space trip and build your home up there, it's safe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/84dff4c0615a76812dd76ff62585f5d0.poster.webp?t=1751399414\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/84dff4c0615a76812dd76ff62585f5d0.webp?t=1751399414\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Learn more about:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow crops right next to your home or build a Giant Greenhouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use barrels to increase the value of your crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy Chickens, Cows, Pigs, Goats, and Ducks for your Ranch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up as you complete activities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy 7+ unique Pets to live with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build relationships with over 30 unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fish over 90+ types of fish while picking your next song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore caves with multiple floors and different kinds of gems to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn recipes and complete your Achievement Room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 12 girls or boys to marry and have a child with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to the Moon, build a house, and meet new creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy new days with different music tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join festivals that bring the whole community together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover secrets hidden al